{"kind": "mod", "id": 1646, "name": "smthing-Configurable Steps Volume", "slug": "smthing-configurable-steps-volume", "teaser": "Lower the volume of your footsteps for you only, bots still hear you normally.", "owner_name": "PenOkOh", "downloads": 10741, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:02:33.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-08-12T18:57:24.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-08-12T18:57:24.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.2.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>Please refer to original mod for description and how to install it. I simply updated it to work on 3.9.X.</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1971-configurable-steps-volume/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CLICK ME-Configurable Steps Volume by smthing</a></strong></p>\n<p>****I streamlined the installation process. Simply drag the user folder into your main Spt Directory and enjoy a world of silence.</p>\n<p>If <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/15199-smthing/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">smthing</a></strong> wants it removed. It will be removed without warning.</p>\n<p><strong>If you wanna edit the volume percentage, go to SPT\\user\\mods\\SPT-ConfigurableStepsVolume-1.1.1 and open the config.json. Change 45 to whatever you prefer. Making it 100 is complete silence. I would go to more than 60.</strong></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.5", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2017, "published_at": "2025-01-03T13:34:41.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1646/smthing-configu